        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 172, Sutton Place 6-1/4 Inch Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sutton Place 6-1/4 Inch Cabinet Pull has traditional appeal for those who want a classic look. This cabinet pull comes with the mounting hardware. The Sutton Place 6-1/4 Inch Cabinet Pull is easy to style because it's timeless look will go with almost any decor. Choose from satin nickel or polished chrome.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+Sutton+Place\">MNG Sutton Place Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 172 Sutton Place 6-1/4 Inch Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
